==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Teddiursa|126}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*'''Honey Snack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Legendary Treasures|Teddiursa|RC15}} from the {{TCG|Legendary Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

